m_r8k_2vn_ABA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《梁書》《南史》王份傳均以琳為其長子。"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-048-zhou48:p001:m0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"錫","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAB","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《梁書》稱琳之第二子，字公嘏；與《宋書》王弘之子王錫為異人。"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-048-zhou48:p001:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"㳬","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABABA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《周書》明記祖琳、父錫、弟湜。梁書作泛，南史作涉；父子敘事及弟湜相合。"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-048-zhou48:p001:m0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"瓘","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABABAA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《周書》王㳬附傳明記其子瓘為黃門侍郎；與晉宋之際王謐之子王瓘分錄。"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-048-zhou48:p001:m0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"㳬","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABABA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《周書》明記祖琳、父錫、弟湜。梁書作泛，南史作涉；父子敘事及弟湜相合。"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-048-zhou48:p001:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"湜","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABABB","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《周書》明記王㳬之弟；梁書、南史附王錫傳均列湜。"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-048-zhou48:p001:m0135","start":135,"end":136,"surface":"懷","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABABBA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《周書》在王湜仕歷、卒年後記其子懷為隋沔陽令。"}],"chapter_id":"c-zhoushu-048-zhou48","book_id":"b-zhoushu-048","work_id":"w-zhoushu","source_id":"s-zhoushu-048-zhou48-ws2432546"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangfen","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangfen-ws1544250","source":{"title":"梁書卷21·王份傳及王琳、王錫附傳","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=梁書/卷21&oldid=1544250","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=梁書/卷21&oldid=1544250","revision_id":1544250,"access